## Book a Kaergar by the hour

Need help for a few hours or a full day? **Book Kaergar** is how you hire verified Panun Kaergar professionals by time — not only by a fixed job name.

Choose a role, pick **1 hour**, **half day (4 hours)**, or **full day (8 hours)**, and a verified pro arrives ready to work.

### What you can book

- **Home Trades** — carpenter, electrician, plumber, painter
- **Building & Site** — mason, labour, welder / fabricator
- **Home Care** — gardener, cleaner
- **Beauty Artists** — makeup artist, mehndi artist

### Good to know

- Packages cover **labour time** only; materials are separate unless agreed on site
- Share your task list when booking so the right professional is assigned
- For help, use call, WhatsApp, website, or the app profile/contact options
